          <div class="image-row-single image-row-single-wide">
            <img data-tilt src={img('lowfi-wireframes.webp')} alt="Eight low-fidelity wireframes for U-M GPT: finishing sentences, changing background color based on conversation, a video analyzer, translation mode, linking to other software, setting tone, exporting past chats as a PDF, and reading text from images and videos" />
